## 😊 Emoji Icon System

### Cách sử dụng Emoji trong React

```jsx
// Component EmojiIcon
const EmojiIcon = ({ emoji, size = 'md', className = '' }) => {
  const sizes = {
    xs: 'text-sm',     // 14px
    sm: 'text-base',   // 16px
    md: 'text-xl',     // 20px
    lg: 'text-2xl',    // 24px
    xl: 'text-3xl',    // 30px
    '2xl': 'text-4xl', // 36px
  };

  return (
    <span 
      className={`inline-flex items-center justify-center ${sizes[size]} ${className}`}
      role="img"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      {emoji}
    </span>
  );
};

// Sử dụng
<EmojiIcon emoji="🐾" size="lg" />
<EmojiIcon emoji="📊" size="xl" />
```

