## 🎯 Best Practices

### 1. Emoji Accessibility
```jsx
// Always use role="img" and aria-hidden for decorative emojis
<span role="img" aria-hidden="true">🐾</span>

// Or aria-label for meaningful emojis
<span role="img" aria-label="Thú cưng">🐾</span>
```

### 2. Consistent Spacing
```jsx
// Use design tokens instead of arbitrary values
<div className="p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8">  {/* ✅ Good */}
<div className="p-[17px]">           {/* ❌ Avoid */}
```

### 3. Loading States
```jsx
const LoadingCard = () => (
  <div className="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg">
    <div className="loading-shimmer h-8 w-8 rounded-full mb-4" />
    <div className="loading-shimmer h-4 w-24 rounded mb-2" />
    <div className="loading-shimmer h-6 w-32 rounded" />
  </div>
);
```

### 4. Error States
```jsx
const ErrorState = ({ message, onRetry }) => (
  <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 px-4">
    <span className="text-6xl mb-4">😵</span>
    <h3 className="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Đã xảy ra lỗi</h3>
    <p className="text-gray-500 mb-4">{message}</p>
    <button 
      onClick={onRetry}
      className="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-lg"
    >
      🔄 Thử lại
    </button>
  </div>
);
```

