## 🔗 Quick Reference

### Common Emoji Pairs
| Action | Emoji Pair |
|--------|------------|
| Success/Error | ✅ / ❌ |
| Up/Down | ⬆️ / ⬇️ |
| Add/Remove | ➕ / ➖ |
| Lock/Unlock | 🔒 / 🔓 |
| Show/Hide | 👁️ / 👁️‍🗨️ |
| Play/Pause | ▶️ / ⏸️ |
| Previous/Next | ◀️ / ▶️ |
| Open/Close | 📂 / 📁 |
